---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="TIRENA's privacy policy.">
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 60px;">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <span class="eyebrow-mark"></span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        TIRENA does not collect personal information directly from visitors beyond
        standard, anonymized website analytics (such as page views) used to understand
        which content is helpful.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site contains affiliate links. If you click one and make a purchase, the
        retailer (such as Amazon) may use its own cookies to track that referral — this
        is governed by that retailer's own privacy policy, not TIRENA's.
      </p>
      <p>
        TIRENA does not sell or share personal data with third parties beyond what's
        necessary for the site to function (such as hosting and analytics providers).
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this policy, you can reach out via the contact
        details on our About page.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft);">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
